        'answer' => '<p><strong>EPR full form is Extended Producer Responsibility: producers, importers and brand owners must take back or recycle the plastic packaging they put on the market.</strong> Under the Plastic Waste Management Rules, 2016 and CPCB’s EPR guidelines, they register on CPCB’s centralised EPR portal, meet yearly targets with EPR certificates from registered plastic waste processors, and file annual returns.</p>',
