            ['Which appliances need a BEE star label?', '<p>Labelling is <strong>mandatory</strong> for appliances notified by BEE, including room air conditioners, refrigerators, colour televisions, storage water heaters, LED lamps, ceiling fans and distribution transformers. Many other products, such as pumps, motors and microwave ovens, have <strong>voluntary</strong> schedules. The list grows as new schedules are notified, so check the current lists of <a href="/resources/standards/bee-mandatory-star-labelling">mandatory BEE star labelling</a> and <a href="/resources/standards/bee-voluntary-star-labelling">voluntary BEE star labelling</a> products.</p>'],
