        'lead' => 'UKCA (UK Conformity Assessed) is the product marking for Great Britain; most products follow the same route as CE. The UK has extended recognition of the CE mark for most goods, so UKCA is often optional, but medical devices, construction products and some other goods follow their own timelines.',
