<tr><td>Medical devices</td><td>Medical devices and IVDs</td><td>Register with the MHRA; manufacturers outside the UK appoint a UK Responsible Person</td></tr>
</tbody></table><p>A <a href="/certification/global-certifications/cb-iecee">CB test report</a> can often be reused for the safety testing.</p>'],
