<li>Product: model, type, batch or serial number.</li>
<li>Name and address of the manufacturer (and of the authorised representative, if any).</li>
<li>This declaration is issued under the sole responsibility of the manufacturer.</li>
<li>Object of the declaration: description of the product, with a photo where helpful.</li>
<li>The object of the declaration is in conformity with the relevant UK legislation: [list the UK regulations].</li>
<li>References to the designated standards or other technical specifications used.</li>
<li>Where applicable: the UK approved body’s name and number, and the certificate it issued.</li>
<li>Additional information.</li>
<li>Signed for and on behalf of: [name, function, place and date of issue, signature].</li>
