        'answer' => '<p><strong>India’s solid waste rules were overhauled in 2016 after a gap of about 16 years:</strong> the Municipal Solid Wastes (Management and Handling) Rules, 2000 were replaced by the Solid Waste Management Rules, 2016. Those were in turn replaced by the Solid Waste Management Rules, 2026, notified on 27 January 2026 and in force from 1 April 2026.</p>',
