<tr><td>2016</td><td>Solid Waste Management Rules, 2016</td><td>Replaced the 2000 rules after about 16 years; extended duties to waste generators, including bulk generators, and required segregation at source</td></tr>
<tr><td>2026</td><td>Solid Waste Management Rules, 2026 (notified 27 January 2026, in force from 1 April 2026)</td><td>Replaced the 2016 rules; four-stream segregation, the polluter pays principle and new duties for bulk waste generators</td></tr>
